{"data":{"body":"**P2:** This omits `CANCELLED`, `TIMED_OUT`, and `STOPPED`, although `ExecutionManager.isTerminalStatus` treats all three as terminal. When one arrives during `pollUntilReady()`, the continuation recursively registers another poll after the operation has completed, potentially issuing checkpoint polls until shutdown. Stop on `READY` or any `ExecutionManager.isTerminalStatus(status)`, reject unknown statuses, and add cancellation/timeout/stop coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76iUt_","finding_digest":"56a2fff1fc12757737aa75b52ee309976376a7843a76db799dc600a086444b83","finding_id":"arf_v1_k2rp74p4cj2xon5kow2s5yyjs5","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/waitforconditionoperation.java::isreadyorterminal::incomplete-terminal-set","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/waitforconditionoperation.java::isreadyorterminal::incomplete-terminal-set","line":136,"observation_digest":"e058e2c574409a4bc96774f6aa01143176b4169e9b6b107db1e962889c49038d","observation_id":"aro_v1_4bmofrluicnexslhot3kuaiugf","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/WaitForConditionOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T05:15:19Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6yg62kl4qwg25je7dp2yjvem3j","reviewed_base_sha":"34c174f2819f715cf26e88aa8dbabd7d40cb9ad8","reviewed_head_sha":"cca1b684263c10269cd0848df68740e2835f3ba8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":134,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_6rmomg6sgk5ff27sgtqepv2ryy","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T05:15:19Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
